Block I/O Bridge

Connects the TFS library's extern rd_read/rd_write to the
disk server's IPC wrappers. No module declaration — this
avoids conflicting with `import oskit.fs.*` in the TFS server
(which imports the TFS library's extern declarations).

The linker resolves the extern disk_read/disk_write to the
disk driver's IPC wrappers (in module oskit).

    extern disk_read(lba: int, addr: *i8) -> int
    extern disk_write(lba: int, addr: *i8) -> int

    rd_read(lba: int, addr: *i8)
        disk_read(lba, addr)

    rd_write(lba: int, addr: *i8)
        disk_write(lba, addr)
